            <p>
                <strong>CRUD</strong> stands for
                <strong>Create, Read, Update and Delete</strong>.
            </p>

            <p>
                These four operations represent the basic actions commonly
                performed on application data.
            </p>

            <p class="mb-0">
                In Angular, CRUD operations are commonly implemented by
                using <strong>HttpClient</strong> to communicate with
                backend REST APIs.
            </p>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- CRUD Flow -->
