            </div>


            <div class="info-card mb-3">

                <strong>
                    3. Update Uses PUT
                </strong>

                <p class="mb-0">
                    PUT can send updated information for an existing resource.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="info-card">

                <strong>
                    4. Delete Uses DELETE
                </strong>

                <p class="mb-0">
